// Pentamoor: a Steam Input layout for the Steam Deck (controller_neptune): the Gamepad template (A B X Y, both sticks and their clicks, both triggers, bumpers, D-pad, View
// and Menu) with both trackpads as a mouse (right: left click, left: right click). Pentamoor reads the Deck as an Xbox-style game controller (SDL's game controller API),
// so the layout only has to hand the real buttons through; the two trackpads and the touch screen are the mouse, which the game uses as it always did.
// UNVERIFIED: written from the format of Steam's own templates without a Steam client to load it in. If Steam does not list it, or the buttons do not do what
// docs/notes/steamdeck.md says, use Steam's own "Gamepad with Mouse Trackpad" template instead (the steps are there).
